@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title AI Vision API Use Cases
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

actor "AI Vision API\n(TBD provider)" as AI

rectangle "Personalized Product Sales and Workshop Booking System" {
  usecase "Receive consented\nreference image" as ReceiveImage
  usecase "Return image quality" as Quality
  usecase "Return candidate ring\nfeatures" as Features
}

AI --> ReceiveImage
AI --> Quality
AI --> Features
ReceiveImage .> Quality : <<include>>
ReceiveImage .> Features : <<include>>

note bottom of AI
The API does not generate a design, decide feasibility or decide price.
end note
@enduml

